== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Red Redemption}}.
* In the '''Antibirth''' mod, this item used to be unlocked by defeating The Witness (Now known as {{e|Mother}}) as {{c|Cain}}.
* During the Kickstarter campaign for [https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/isaacfoursouls/the-binding-of-isaac-4-souls-requiem The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls Requiem], the Red Key was revealed to be present in Repentance by developer Kilburn.<ref>https://twitter.com/FixItVinh/status/1409960357934796803</ref>
* Red Rooms may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Plagues of Egypt|the Plagues of Egypt]]'' in the Bible where the tenth and final plague, death of first-born, could be prevented by painting lambs blood on their doors, making them red.

